🧩 OVERVIEW

We’ll build 3 layers:

Collector (Python) → receives cloned INT packets from BMv2.

Metrics Storage (InfluxDB) → stores hop-by-hop telemetry data.

Visualization (Grafana) → real-time dashboard for latency, queue, etc.

'⚙️ STEP 1 — Environment setup'
Install dependencies
sudo apt update
sudo apt install python3-pip python3-scapy influxdb influxdb-client grafana -y


Start the services:

sudo systemctl enable influxdb --now
sudo systemctl enable grafana-server --now

